00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:11,720
Oh.

568
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,280
Oh.

569
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,280
Sen.

570
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:16,400
Hello.

571
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,520
You must be really mad at me.

572
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:21,440
Yes.

573
00:38:22,720 --> 00:38:24,440
You know that 
the gambling den belongs to your enemy.

574
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:26,200
How could you send me there alone?

575
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:29,000
Don’t tell me that you didn’t order that.

576
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,120
You are the boss.

577
00:38:30,120 --> 00:38:31,400
You are responsible for it.

578
00:38:32,440 --> 00:38:33,640
Do you want me to get killed?

579
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:36,160
So what?

580
00:38:37,080 --> 00:38:38,040
Do you want to punch me?

581
00:38:38,200 --> 00:38:38,800
Can I do that?

582
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:52,080
Your punch is so weak.

583
00:38:52,360 --> 00:38:53,000
Don’t use it. 

584
00:39:03,200 --> 00:39:03,800
I’m sorry.

585
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:11,600
Den sent you to Tot’s gambling den alone.

586
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:12,880
I’m sorry about that.

587
00:39:16,640 --> 00:39:17,040
Fine.

588
00:39:18,640 --> 00:39:19,320
Is that all?

589
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:23,880
I have a question.

590
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:29,280
Why do you want to join my gang so badly?

591
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:44,440
I’m looking for my mom.

592
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:47,240
I heard that she moved to Thonburi.

593
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:50,720
I was told 
that you are well-connected in the area.

594
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:04,440
So you want to join my gang 
because you need my help?

595
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,280
Yes.

596
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:10,240
You see how we live.

597
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:14,200
Risking our necks all the time isn’t fun.

598
00:40:14,480 --> 00:40:15,360
If it’s that so, 

599
00:40:17,560 --> 00:40:18,960
then why are you still doing it?

600
00:40:25,920 --> 00:40:28,960
I have something I have to get done.

601
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:32,880
I have to find my mother.

602
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:54,120
I accept you into my gang.

603
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:57,720
Huh?

604
00:40:59,920 --> 00:41:00,520
Why?

605
00:41:04,640 --> 00:41:05,160
Go.

606
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:06,440
Go home.

607
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:07,800
Get your wounds treated.

608
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:30,200
Here is the money I borrowed from you.

609
00:41:31,680 --> 00:41:33,080
Uncle Saman paid back his debt?

610
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:35,280
You completed your task.

611
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:37,960
I have to accept you into my gang 
as I promised.

612
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:41,920
This means 

613
00:41:42,560 --> 00:41:45,640
I’m both your man and your henchman?

614
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:51,040
So…

615
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:54,640
Whatever names I called you earlier, 

616
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:56,680
I’ll take them back.

617
00:41:56,960 --> 00:41:58,480
Can you forget it?

618
00:41:59,560 --> 00:42:00,120
Do you hear me?

619
00:42:08,320 --> 00:42:09,600
You are now a part of the Gaoyod Gang.

620
00:42:10,520 --> 00:42:11,640
You need to brush your hair.

621
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:13,680
Don’t ruin my reputation.

622
00:42:17,000 --> 00:42:17,960
Sure.

623
00:42:18,240 --> 00:42:19,520
I’ll do it right now.

624
00:42:33,160 --> 00:42:35,160
THONBURI GANGSTERS

625
00:42:41,880 --> 00:42:42,800
I look pretty cool.

626
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:02,440
Can I ask you something?

627
00:43:03,040 --> 00:43:07,560
Between Hongsen Gaoyod 
and Zeng Klookfoon, 

628
00:43:08,600 --> 00:43:09,560
who do you think is better?

629
00:43:10,600 --> 00:43:11,520
I think…

630
00:43:13,680 --> 00:43:14,440
Hongsen is better.

631
00:43:15,120 --> 00:43:17,840
I think Zeng is very tough.

632
00:43:18,520 --> 00:43:19,280
How?

633
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:21,160
His gang’s name means rolling in dirt.

634
00:43:22,080 --> 00:43:24,200
Doesn’t it mean he must be beaten so often 

635
00:43:24,200 --> 00:43:25,720
that he’s covered with dirt?

636
00:43:33,560 --> 00:43:34,080
Hey.

637
00:43:36,600 --> 00:43:40,960
Kiddos, have some respect 
when talking about my boss.

638
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:42,400
Do you hear me?

639
00:43:44,200 --> 00:43:45,360
You can respect your boss.

640
00:43:45,360 --> 00:43:46,720
But he’s my son.

641
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:47,800
Go back to your seat.

642
00:43:48,640 --> 00:43:49,560
Come on.

643
00:43:49,840 --> 00:43:50,440
Do you want to be hit again?

644
00:43:50,800 --> 00:43:51,320
That’s enough.

645
00:43:57,760 --> 00:43:59,320
Rolling in dirt.

646
00:44:02,520 --> 00:44:04,520
- You’d better make everyone in the gang 
accept you.

647
00:44:04,760 --> 00:44:06,160
- Why do you hate me? Just tell me.

648
00:44:06,160 --> 00:44:07,920
- What do you have to earn my acceptance?

649
00:44:08,320 --> 00:44:09,920
- Compete against me in a shooting match.

650
00:44:10,360 --> 00:44:12,320
- If you win, I’ll accept you.

651
00:44:12,560 --> 00:44:13,560
- Just wait and see.

652
00:44:13,760 --> 00:44:15,440
- I’ll show you that I can beat Den.

653
00:44:15,440 --> 00:44:16,360
- We are closed.

654
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:17,480
- You can close the application.

655
00:44:17,480 --> 00:44:18,760
- I already applied.

656
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:20,400
- Where did you get that confidence?

657
00:44:20,640 --> 00:44:22,640
- I told you. I like it here.

658
00:44:23,080 --> 00:44:25,680
- You can’t beat me in everything, Zoe.
